  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tanzania Humanitarian Assistance Programme (THAP).</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Tanzania Humanitarian Assistance Programme (THAP) will support more effective and principled humanitarian action that meets the needs of refugees and asylum seekers in line with the UK commitments in the International Development Strategy. In the short term, programme will prioritise immediate needs of new arrivals and maintains appropriate cost-effective humanitarian protection assistance for the protracted refugee caseloads. THAP aims at a long-term approach towards policy changes through targeted policy advocacy, influencing and coordination.</narrative>
  </description>
